    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere aganteebia, “Aye Mwanyabaanto, tenena namagoro ao, inche nkwane naye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero akwanete nainche, Omoika ogasoa ime y’ane, ogantenenia, erio nkamotegerera oria orenge gokwana nainche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere aganteebia, “Aye Mwanyabaanto, nkogotoma inde gochia ase Abaisraeli, egesaku ekio getari koigwera, ekio giantigire inche. Abanto abwo amo ne chisokoro chiabo babeire bagosaria asende nonya ngoika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abwo nigo banyiretie amasio abo ne chinkoro chiabo. Nao nkogotoma gochia ase bare, goika obateebie iga: Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobaraigwe, gose bange koigwa (ekiagera barabwo negesaku getari koigwera), mbamanye ng’a omobani obeire ase egati yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende aye Mwanyabaanto, tobaisa kobairoka, gose koiroka amang’ana abo, nonya goetananire namageri na amagwa, naende komenyete ase egati y’ebiuge. Ee, tobaisa kwoboa ekero orarore amasio abo, gose kwoboa amang’ana abo, ekiagera abwo nigo bare egesaku getari koigwera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana nkogoteebia naro orabateebie kobarayategerere gose bayaange, ekiagera barabwo negesaku getari koigwera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende aye Mwanyabaanto, tegerera aya nkogoteebia; tobaisa koba oyo otari koigwera buna egesaku eke getari koigwera. Asamia omonwa oo, orie egento eke ngokoa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero narigereretie, nkarora okoboko koramboire gocha asende, na ase okoboko okwo egetabu yaringire yarengeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egetabu keria gekaramborwa ase obosio bwane; nero nigo yariikire bosio na magega. Amang’ana ariikire aroro nigo arenge ay’amagombo, na okweumia, na okorera kw’obobe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
